## Summary

**Golden Rule:**

> **NEVER commit code that doesn't build successfully.**

Every change, no matter how small, must pass:
1. ✅ Biome checks (`npm run check`)
2. ✅ Build (`npm run build`)
3. ✅ Tests (`npm run test:e2e:ci`) - if applicable

This ensures code quality, type safety, and prevents breaking changes from reaching production.
